      "proposed_content": "Starting from arcsine and inverse-hyperbolic-sine coefficient series, the paper builds iterated-integral hierarchies whose repeated integration raises the denominator/logarithmic order; repeated integration by parts then converts the coefficient sums into log-sine or log-sinh moment integrals after the corresponding trigonometric or hyperbolic substitution.",
