      "proposed_content": "The circular and hyperbolic logarithmic moments are parallel generating constructions: exponential factorization and inverse-hyperbolic-sine series lead to log-sinh moments, whereas unit-circle contours and iterated arcsine series lead to log-sine moments; the substitution of an imaginary argument converts the arcsine coefficient construction into its inverse-hyperbolic-sine companion.",
